## No-Mock Gate

Do not fabricate endpoint responses, rows, success statuses, or admin-control effects. Every endpoint must be marked:

- `verified` when a real route and command evidence exists.
- `blocked` when configuration, credentials, permissions, schema, or upstream availability prevents verification.
- `unverified` when the route or data model has not been proven yet.

